      "translation": "However, since I lacked the qualifications to become a great educator from the beginning, I felt constrained and fearful. Kano-san also said that you were too honest and it bothered you, so maybe you should have been more lenient. However, no matter what, it just seemed like a place I wasn't suited for. To be honest with you, at the time I was like a confectioner who went to help out at a confectionery shop."
