      "translation": "I was also in Matsuyama for only one year. When I was about to stand up, the governor stopped me, but since I had already made an agreement with the other party, I finally refused and left. Then, I settled down at a high school in Kumamoto. I have experience teaching in this order from junior high school to high school and then from high school to university, but I have not yet had the experience of teaching elementary school and girls' school."
