      "translation": "However, no matter how much people praise me, I'm still worried because I've always borrowed from others and am proud of myself. It's like wearing peacock feathers and showing off without hands. So, I began to realize that if I didn't let go of the buoyancy and put my heart into it, no matter how much time passed, I wouldn't be able to feel peace in my heart."
