      "translation": "Then, in order to solidify my stance on literature, or rather to build a new one, I began reading books that had nothing to do with literature. To put it simply, I finally thought about the four words \"self-centeredness\" and began to indulge in scientific research and philosophical speculation in order to prove my true self-centeredness. Times are different now, and people with some intelligence should be able to understand this well, but at that time, I was childish and the world was not that advanced, so the way I did it was actually unavoidable."
