      "translation": "I confess that I started anew from those four characters. I thought it would be really fun for me, and that people would be really happy, if I tried to lay out in front of them the compelling reasons why it's okay not to be so Western, because it would be very unsatisfactory to just ride on other people's butts and make a fuss like I do now, so I decided to make it my life's work to accomplish this through writing and other means."
