      "translation": "At that moment, my anxiety completely disappeared. I looked at the gloomy London with a cheerful heart. To put it metaphorically, after many years of suffering, I felt as if I had finally dug my crane's beak into a mine. To reiterate, what has been kept in a fog until now has been clearly shown the path that it should take from a certain angle."
