      "translation": "By the time I was enlightened, more than a year had passed since I had studied abroad. So, I realized that there was no way I could finish my business in a foreign country, so I decided to gather up all the materials I could, and then return to my home country and put an end to it. In other words, when I returned home, I accidentally gained more power than when I went abroad."
