      "translation": "However, my idea of ​​self-centeredness still persists. It gets stronger and stronger as the years go by. As a literary project, it ended in failure, but the belief that I was the master and everyone else was a guest gave me the great confidence and peace of mind that I hold today. I feel like I can still be alive today as a continuation of that. In fact, it may be thanks to that power that I am able to stand on such a high platform and give a lecture to you all."
