      "translation": "However, in certain cases--for example, when taking classes, becoming a soldier, or making military life the main priority in a dormitory--in all such cases, you will be exempted from some degree of coercive measures. However, I am mainly talking about what happened when you went out on your own and went out into the world, so you have to listen to it with that in mind."
