      "translation": "If we summarize the points we have made so far, first of all, if we want to develop our own individuality, we must also respect the individuality of others. Second, if you wish to use the power you possess, you must be aware of the duties that accompany it. Thirdly, if you wish to demonstrate your financial power, you must take on the responsibility that comes with it. In other words, it comes down to these three points."
