      "translation": "I don't mean to model anything after Britain, but I think that freedom without a sense of obligation is not true freedom. This is because such selfish freedom can never exist in society. Even if they exist, they are bound to be immediately ostracized and crushed. I long for you to be free. At the same time, I hope that you will be convinced of your obligation. In this sense, I am not afraid to proclaim that I am an individualist."
