      "translation": "All of these harmful effects arise from a lack of understanding of moral individualism, and are nothing but selfish attempts to promote oneself to the general public through power and money. Therefore, individualism, the individualism I am describing here, is not at all dangerous to the nation as ordinary people think, and my interpretation is that one respects oneself at the same time as respecting other beings, so I think it is a fine principle."
